---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use" description="AapkaNeta.org ke istemaal ki shartein — site ka sahi istemaal kaise karein.">
  <style>
    .l-hero { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 44px 0; }
    .l-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .l-hero p { color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 680px; }
    .l-block { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .l-block h2 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block p, .l-block li { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
    .l-block p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 22px; }
    .l-block li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  </style>

  <div class="l-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p>Is site ka istemaal karke aap neeche di gayi sharton se sahmat hote hain.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>1. Site ka uddeshya</h2>
      <p>AapkaNeta.org nagrik-shiksha ka project hai — chune hue pratinidhiyon ke kaam ka saboot-sahit record. Ye kisi neta, party ya sarkar ka prachaar ya virodh nahi karta.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>2. Jaankari ka istemaal</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site ki jaankari personal, gair-vyaapaarik istemaal ke liye mukt hai.</li>
        <li>Jaankari ko copy/publish karte waqt <b>srot ka hawala</b> dein (AapkaNeta.org aur mool srot dono).</li>
        <li>Site ki jaankari ko badal kar, galat sandarbh me, ya kisi neta ko badnaam karne ke liye istemaal na karein.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>3. Correction ka adhikaar</h2>
      <p>Galat jaankari dikhe to <a href="/methodology/#correction" style="color:#fbbf24">correction process</a> se sudhaar ka anurodh kar sakte hain. Saboot-sahit correction ki 48 ghante me jaanch hoti hai.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>4. Nishedh</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site ko automated tareeke se scrape karke bulk data nikalna (robots.txt ke niyam todena).</li>
        <li>Site ke naam ya design ka istemaal karke bhram paida karna.</li>
        <li>Correction form ka durupyog (spam, jhoothe aarop).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>5. Zimmedaari ki seema</h2>
      <p>Hum tathyon ki satyata ke liye uchit jaanch karte hain, lekin poorn satyata ki guarantee nahi dete. Vistaar se padhein: <a href="/disclaimer/" style="color:#fbbf24">Disclaimer</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>6. Badlaav</h2>
      <p>Ye shartein samay-samay par update ho sakti hain. Lagataar istemaal ka matlab updated sharton se sahmati hai.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
